    { question: "Will any HDMI cable work with 4K at 120Hz?", answer: "No. The source, display and cable must support the required format and bandwidth. Look for a properly certified Ultra High Speed HDMI cable for common 4K/120Hz setups and verify the connected devices' capabilities." },
